  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, combine the white wine vinegar <br>and a good pinch of sugar and salt.<br>• Add shredded cabbage mix to pickling liquid. Add <br>enough water to just cover cabbage. Set aside. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-f5afd400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, slice cucumber into thin rounds.<br>• Slice lemon into wedges.<br>• Halve snacking tomatoes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-63b1e510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Set your air fryer to 200°C.<br>• Place spinach falafel in air fryer basket. Lightly coat <br>or spray with olive oil and bake until golden and <br>heated through, 5-7 minutes.</p> <p><br>TIP: No air fryer? Halve spinach falafel. In a large frying <br>pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium<br>high heat. When oil is hot, cook falafels, turning halfway, <br>until golden brown, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a paper <br>towel-lined plate.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-613fcb20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the falafel is baking, in a small bowl, combine <br>Greek-style yoghurt, dill &amp; parsley mayonnaise <br>and a generous squeeze of lemon juice. <br>• Season to taste with salt and pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-e5ea1f30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Microwave flatbreads on a microwave-safe plate in <br>10 second bursts until warmed through.<br>• Slice flatbreads into quarters. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-51a15040.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Drain pickled cabbage.<br>• Divide spinach falafel, flatbreads, pickled cabbage, <br>tomatoes, cucumber rounds, Kalamata olives,  <br>dill-yoghurt sauce and fetta cubes between plates. <br>Drizzle olive oil over tomatoes and cucumber. <br>Season to taste.<br>• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc63bcb653703ca9a7d6/step-804b5a50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
